{"title":"1999 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/2/d02039d621ba86e20cd5543bbef2b1d9c90c0e03.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\sqrt{25} - \\sqrt{9})^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"103\" height=\"24\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/a/44a10460b71fa0a234fc26cd2d17fdcc4339ebdc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ 26 \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ 16 \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ 34 \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ 8 \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"415\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/b/78bb0832835948c89dee9d1d833c55e89362b413.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{25} = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"68\" height=\"21\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/6/4862fadfb120a13a3301ca2028bf9eb3fc75b696.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{9} = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"59\" height=\"21\" />, so we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/9/2099b0d474d1d286be4a447c054dbb79eac87ac5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\sqrt{25} - \\sqrt{9})^{2} = (5 - 3)^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"189\" height=\"24\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/c/8fc650c96c166b4d88289be8acaea219869843b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=2^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/b/f9bace000d0899ac104071f2a64c0d9bb5a6938f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\boxed {\\textbf {(E) } 4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"75\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Fermat\" title=\"1999 CEMC Fermat\">1999 CEMC Fermat</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Fermat_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1999 CEMC Fermat Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Fermat_Answer_Key\" title=\"1999 CEMC Fermat Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Problem</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_2\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"1999 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_2\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"1999 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1999 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_